window.products.push({"id":235032,"name":"Cuisinart CCO-50BKN Deluxe Electric Can Opener, Black & Swing-A-Way Portable Can Opener, Black 7-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.38,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31ikkmcTqUL._AC_.jpg","description":"Cuisinart CCO-50BKN Deluxe Electric Can Opener, BlackCuisinart CCO-50BKN Deluxe electric can opener, blackelectric can opener with precision power cut blade press-and-release lever for easily opening any standard-size can extra-wide base prevents sliding or tipping; stops automatically magnetic lid holder; removable activation lever; easy-to-clean design Measures 5-8/9 by 6 by 10-8/9 inches; 3-year limited warranty Features: Cuisinart quality-engineered motor system|Power Cut blade|Single-touch operation|Sturdy base prevents sliding or tipping|Opens any size can|Removable activation lever for easy cleaning|Limited 3-year warranty|BPA freeSwing-A-Way 407BK Portable Can Opener, BlackSince 1938, Swing-A-Way  has created the highest quality, most dependable can openers on the market. Soon to become one of your go-to kitchen gadgets, it's comfortable to hold and compact for easy storage. When you reach for a Swing-A-Way, you reach for a classic. This Swing-A-Way Portable Can Opener is extremely durable, with an all-steel construction. Soft cushion-grips for ensure a comfortable grip while opening various cans. A high-carbon, gear-driven cutting wheel and skip-proof feed for smooth and easy usage. Features an integrated bottle opener on the side. No need to purchase a separate bottle opener - now you can have two kitchen tools in one! Quickly and easily remove bottle caps in one swift movement. Hand wash with warm water and a mild detergent, rinse and dry immediately. Measures 8.5-inch long. Lifetime limited warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31ikkmcTqUL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cuisinart","source_asin":"B07QV4NKFW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-235032","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QV4NKFW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QV4NKFW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":235033,"name":"Homykic Laundry Basket with Lid, 97L Large Hamper Clothes Storage Basket with Bamboo Handles, Foldable Tall Laundry Organizer for Dorm, Bathroom, Bedr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hZ6A73uJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"60% cotton, 40% polyester KEEP YOUR LAUNDRY ORGANIZED - If you're tired of laundry piles getting mixed together and making a mess, this large laundry hamper with lid is for you. It keeps all your dirty clothes neatly organized and hidden from view until the next wash day. Measuring 16.4” L x 13.2” D x 27.6” H, with a capacity of up to 97L, it is ideal for family use. LAUNDRY HAMPER WITH LID & HANDLES - Foldable hamper with lid can hide the laundry and keep dust out. Open-top design that makes it easy to toss laundry inside. The laundry airs during storage thanks to the handles with holes. Top metal handle for easy opening and the side bamboo handles make it easy to carry from room to room. COLLAPSIBLE LAUNDRY BASKET - This collapsible laundry basket stands tall and sturdy while in use and can be folded flat if not, which saves space and allows for easy storage. The height of the folded hamper is 1.5” (1 PCS). It is very lightweight and also suitable for RV travel, easy assembly is required. MOISTUREPROOF & WASHABLE - The folding laundry hamper does not absorb moisture or odors from the laundry because it is made of thick polyester. The plastic coating on the hamper outside makes it easy to wipe dry and more durable. It's washable so you can help keep the clothes hamper fresh and clean in your closet or laundry room. MORE THAN JUST A LAUNDRY ORGANIZER - With neutral colors and straightforward lines, designed to fit in your bathroom, bedroom, laundry room, closet, dorm, nursery, and more. You can use this folding hamper for storing more than just laundry, like your child’s toys, blankets, or just keeping clutter out of sight.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hZ6A73uJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homykic","source_asin":"B0BFHWPZDP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-235033","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFHWPZDP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFHWPZDP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
