window.products.push({"id":235060,"name":"ObboMed HR-7330N, New & Handy AIR Valve for Easy Inflation/deflation, 3 Layers Inflatable Travel Foot Rest Pillow, Foldable & Height Adjustable Pillow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615-6l-t6JL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"PVC + velour Advanced double-layered air valve for easy inflation and deflation. Inflation by only through the upper air valve, and deflation by simply releasing the lower layer valve - no worries of losing air while inflating the basin and no frustration for any difficult deflation. Easy inflation by mouth or pump. This foot rest pillow can be a support when you want to stretch or curl your legs and it can also raise your legs to help blood circulation of the lower body, prevent the risk of getting a DVT (Deep Vein Thrombosis), and the reduction of legs / feet swelling, muscle strain, stress and fatigue when you are traveling on airplane, train and bus. It is also a great portable bed and seat for small children to sleep and sit while traveling. The footrest pillow has 2 valves and each corresponds to an independent air chamber. Its 3 layers and 2 valves design enables you to adjust the height of the pillow to your most desirable level by inflating the air to only 1 layer, 2 layers or all 3 layers of the pillow. Even if the whole cushion is not fully inflated, the cushion wouldn’t be soft and floaty as the 1 valve is responsible for the inflation of 1 layer of the foot rest and another valve is responsible for the inflation of the ot The velour-coated PVC made foot rest pillow can be cleaned with a damp cloth. Furthermore, it doesn’t have an unpleasant plastic smell and the outer velour provides a comfortable touch which is even better for small children to use it as a bed. 180 days Warranty for any defects in materials and workmanship starting from the date you receive our ObboMed HR-7330N!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615-6l-t6JL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OBBO MED","source_asin":"B07K1B1V3H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-235060","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07K1B1V3H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07K1B1V3H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
