window.products.push({"id":235177,"name":"Levtex Home - Mockingbird - Euro Sham (26 x 26in.) Set of 2 - Stamped Floral Print - Dark Grey, Light Grey, Cream - 100% Cotton","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ZyNsosRlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cotton LEVTEX MOCKINGBIRD COLLECTION: The Stamped Floral Print Euro Shams (Set of 2) complements the Mockingbird bedding collection. Use them to add the finishing touch to your bed. Not just decorative, euro shams are great to prop you up in bed, whether to read, enjoy television or just hang out. The shams feature stamped dark grey and white floral batik pattern on a light grey ground. THE MOCKINGBIRD DESIGN: One of our most popular collections Mockingbird is inspired by traditional french toile patterns. The sophisticated grey stamped floral shams are a great accessory for any bedroom. SOFT AND COMFORTABLE LUXURY: Made from 100% cotton that will never feel heavy, stiff or uncomfortable, the Mockingbird euro sham set has an ultra soft feel that you will simply love. It will give your bedroom a feeling of comfort and luxury. EASY CARE: Pre washed for your convenience, the Mockingbird euro sham set is easy to look after. Simply machine wash on a cold, gentle cycle, then line dry or tumble dry at low temperature. COORDINATE YOUR HOME: Create a wonderful space with our coordinated Mockingbird Collection. The design brings traditional, toile accents into your home and will match a variety of different looks. You can also freshen your room with matching and complementary drapes, shower curtains, euros,throw blankets and coordinating decorative pillows from the Levtex Home collection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ZyNsosRlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Levtex Home","source_asin":"B072Y8R3RZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-235177","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072Y8R3RZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072Y8R3RZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":235178,"name":"70th Birthday Gift Coolie Made 1953 Can Coolies 2 Pack Can Coolie Drink Coolers Coolies Patriotic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81N8FG3iofL._AC_SL1226_.jpg","description":"The best birthday gift is a funny birthday gift. Celebrate with a funny 70th birthday gift! This 2-sided coolie is 2 great designs combined - one on each side of the coolie. This vintage style can cooler is perfect for keeping your drink cool while the party heats up. Perfect gift or party favor. QUANTITY: You have chosen a 2-pack. You will receive 2 can coolies. Premium full color sublimation printing creates vibrant and long lasting colors. SIZE: Holds 12 oz cans or 12-16 oz bottles. Folds flat for easy storage. Machine washable. MATERIAL: Premium 1/8 inch thick high density open cell polyurethane foam keeps beverages cool. DESIGN: The pictured design will be featured on both sides of the coolie so that you can see it from every angle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81N8FG3iofL._AC_SL1226_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ThisWear","source_asin":"B09JBCGWC9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-235178","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JBCGWC9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JBCGWC9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":235179,"name":"Inshere Sand Free Microfiber Beach Towel, Quick Dry Super Absorbent Ultra Lightweight Compact, Perfect for Outdoor/Camping/Yoga/Gym, Ideal Travel Bath","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614lIVyqv+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"FAST DRYING and CLEAN The microfiber towel is much more comfortable, soft and cozy for your skin and face touch. Due to its super absorbent characteristic, it can dry you and your face much quickly. Just expand it in the air after you use, and in the short time you can use again. Drying itself so fast, so it is clean and no odor. The towel is sand proof, when you have fun in sand beach it is the best choice. CARING TIPS Before first use, it is suggested to washing your new towel . Wash it in cold or gentle water. Tumble and Air dry will do. Do not iron. Do not bleach. Do not wash with sharp things.  Unfold size: 63\"x32\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614lIVyqv+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"INSHERE","source_asin":"B09F2Z9LPQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-235179","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09F2Z9LPQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09F2Z9LPQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":235180,"name":"SHAG RUG SALE 5' X 8' BEIGE CREAM TRELLIS SHAG RUG CONTEMPORARY MODERN (5'3\"x 7'9\" Actual)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1zVQoqHbmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Shaggy Rug is Premium Quality that consist of 3 kg per square meters of highest quality yarns. This rug gives you very soft and plush feeling under foot with very practical and stylish look. Shag rugs are woven with a long pile which has a shaggy appearance. Unlike the construction of other rug types, shag rugs are not sheared, leaving long pieces of material to create a lush, soft, fluffy look. We only carry woven shag rugs, not the INEXPENSIVE tufted constructions. Our shaggy rugs made out of 100% polypropylene(olefin) with DOUBLE and SINGLE twisted HIGHEST QUALITY yarns. Pile height is approximately 4-5 cm.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1zVQoqHbmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DESIGNER RUGS","source_asin":"B00H9Y38EU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-235180","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00H9Y38EU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00H9Y38EU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":235181,"name":"Ambesonne Green Fitted Sheet & Pillow Sham Set, Mexican Texas Cactus Plants Spikes Cartoon Like Print, Decorative Printed 3 Piece Bedding Decor Set, F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71g3tizP8tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Your purchase will help victims of recent major earthquakes in Turkey since we donate a percentage of our profits to local NGOs helping with quake relief efforts. Measurements - 1 full size sheet 54\" wide X 75\" long & 2 pillow shams 30\" wide X 20\" long. Made from - Super soft 100% brushed microfiber fabric. Sheet and sham set with modern prints. Features - All-round elastic pocket, fits mattresses up to 16\". Sham has an envelope closure. Machine washable - In cold cycle. Sturdy. Comfortable and decorative for bedrooms, hotels, dorms. Printed - With state of the art digital printing technology. Items Printed on the front side only.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71g3tizP8tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ambesonne","source_asin":"B0BPD4DTZF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-235181","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPD4DTZF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPD4DTZF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":235182,"name":"3M Cleaner Floor Pad 5300, 12\" Diameter, Blue (Case of 5)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.3,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91krKWZdZwL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description For heavy-duty scrubbing prior to recoating. Can also be used for heavy-duty spray cleaning or foam scrubbing. Removes dirt, spills and scuffs, leaving a clean surface ready for recoating. Equipment Type: Rotary or Automatic Machine Speed: Low Speed, 175-600 RPM From the Manufacturer 3M™ Blue Cleaner Pad 5300 is designed for heavy-duty scrubbing to remove dirt, spills, scuffs, and worn finish from floors, leaving clean surfaces ready for recoating. An open-textured, non-woven construction resists loading and clogging. Conformable nylon and polyester fibers maximize pad-to-floor contact. The web is coated throughout with high-quality resin and abrasives, which provide high performance throughout the life of the floor cleaner pad. The scrubbing pad can also be used in spray-cleaning and foam-scrubbing operations. It is available in sizes for round and rectangular floor machines. 3M™ Floor Scrubbing Pads are designed to remove worn finish, soils, scuffs, and spills and to prepare surfaces for recoating. The pads are constructed of high-quality nylon and polyester synthetic fibers in a non-woven web. A durable resin coating system permeates the fibers throughout the pad with abrasive cleaning particles, providing consistent performance over the life of the pad. The resin coating will not be significantly affected by water, detergents, and cleaners normally used for floor maintenance. The floor scrubbing pads are reversible and approximately 1 inch thick. Depending on the surface and application, floor pads can be used with detergent solutions for dry scrubbing floors, and in heavy-duty spray cleaning operations. For more than a century, 3M has applied innovation and technology to improving our customers’ lives and supporting their business goals. Today the company, from its headquarters in St. Paul, Minnesota, serves industrial and commercial customers and consumers in nearly 200 countries. Building and Commercial Services products—a diverse category including environmental monitors, floor mats, fire barriers, and cleaning solutions—help customers maintain clean, safe, and attractive facilities. The 3M brand, across thousands of products, represents consistency, superior quality, and value.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91krKWZdZwL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"3M","source_asin":"B006LW2Z3Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-235182","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B006LW2Z3Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B006LW2Z3Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
