window.products.push({"id":235200,"name":"2 Pack Slushie Maker Cup, TIK TOK Frozen Magic Smoothies Cup, Double Layers Silica Cup, DIY Homemade Slushies, Cooling Maker Cup, Freeze Mug Tools, Po","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616d6+nbObL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍧Get a smoothie fast---Slushie maker cup builts in refrigerant. Pour in your favorite drink and squeeze it. Just 2 minutes and you can taste a delicious smoothie. It can be paired with juice or soda, or it can be added with milk to make a thick milkshake or ice cream. 🍧Safety material---Smoothie cup use food-grade silicone and pp materials, environmentally friendly, healthy, and safe to eat.Frozen Magic Slushy Maker is 100% safe for you and your kids. Its built-in freezing liquid, can available in a short time turn drinks into refreshing slush. It is removable, soaped after use, and refrozen for reuse. 🍧Easy to use---Slushie Cup easy to operate, just put this slushy cup into the freezer layer of the refrigerator for 4-6 hours, and then pour any beverage you like, (pay attention to the amount of liquid poured, do not exceed 2/3 of the cup body, so as not to spill.) squeeze it, then you can enjoy the delicious smoothie! Everyone can make a smoothie at home and enjoy the process. 🍧2 in 1 Straw with Spoon---Product includes 2× User manuals, 2×Slushy maker cups, 2×Cup cleaning brushs, 2×Tube cleaning brushs, 2× Straw with spoon(2-in-1). The spoon attached to the straw can be used as a spoon or a straw to meet your different needs. 🍧Reusable---Frozen magic squeeze cup easy to clean and convenient. Use the included brush to clean the smoothie cup and do not touch the white ice bag with sharp objects to avoid breaking it. 🍧Summer surprise gift---Slushie cup maker is the best creative gift for your loved ones, family, friends, colleagues, classmates and kids. Everyone can enjoy the process of making smoothies at home. 🍧After-sales service---If you encounter any problem, you can click contact us in the order, we will reply you within 24 hours and give you a satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616d6+nbObL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lytoybe","source_asin":"B09TPR27NX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-235200","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TPR27NX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TPR27NX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":235201,"name":"Gourmet Settings Oslo 20-Piece Stainless Steel Flatware Set, Service for 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41N9GKRJHwL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Named for the Norwegian city, Gourmet Settings Oslo flatware is cosmopolitan yet comfortable, a satisfying blend that looks and feels great for casual meals and celebrations. Handcrafted from high-quality, heat-forged stainless steel, the pattern features long, lean handles with a slight flare, rounded sides, and blunt tips. A ringed detail just below the neck adds tailored flair, while the working ends feature understatedly contemporary silhouettes. Continental sizing and a gleaming polished finish complete the design. This Oslo set features 20 pieces total with service for four. Each place setting includes a dinner fork, a dinner knife, a salad fork, a table spoon, and a teaspoon. All pieces are safe in the dishwasher for easy cleanup, and Gourmet Settings includes a 25-year warranty. What’s in the Box 4 place settings. Place setting includes: dinner fork; dinner knife; salad fork; table spoon; teaspoon. 20 pieces total. Amazon.com With its bold lines and gleaming finish, Oslo flatware from Gourmet Settings creates a table that is both sophisticated and refreshingly contemporary. Heat-forged for durability, the pattern features comfortably broad handles that narrow to a stacked ring accent at the collar. Squared off corner on the fork ends and generous oval bowls on the spoons complete the modern styling, and a mirror polish adds refinement. With 20 pieces in all, this Oslo set includes four place settings, each with a salad fork, a dinner fork, a knife, a soupspoon, and a teaspoon. Crafted from 18/10 stainless steel, the set is corrosion-resistant, safe in the dishwasher, and designed to keep its finish without polishing. Oslo serving pieces are also available, and Gourmet Settings covers the pattern with a 50-year warranty. --Emily Bedard What's in the Box 4 place settings. Each place setting consists of: dinner fork; salad fork; soupspoon; knife; teaspoon. 20 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41N9GKRJHwL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gourmet Settings","source_asin":"B000ND0OUA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-235201","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000ND0OUA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000ND0OUA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
