window.products.push({"id":235215,"name":"Premium Quality Laser Art Engraved Absorbent Cork Drink Coasters by GrafixMat, Set of 4, Natural Cork, Dual Layer Won’t Chip or Break, Cushion Feet, C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zw8b3kf2L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"MADE WITH FINEST MATERIALS TO LAST MANY YEARS, HIGH QUALITY COASTERS THAT WON’T CHIP OR BREAK: These absorbent cork drink coasters are built to last many, many years. We use only the finest materials so they won’t chip, crack or break. You’ll be captivated and amazed at the fine-line detail of laser-engraved designs on cork. Each graphic coaster features a story and a colorful illustration on the back side – adding entertainment and educational value. EARTH FRIENDLY CORK IS RESPONSIBLY HARVESTED & NO CORK TREES ARE EVER HARMED:  No trees are ever cut down to make our cork drink coaster products and we prioritize the protection of cork trees that live from 100-200 years! Our cork is carefully harvested by only the most skilled and experienced workers in the forests of Portugal and Spain. The natural materials selected to create GrafixMat drink coasters are renewable to preserve the environment. We use recycled and Green Certified Materials. DESIGNED WITH FELT FEET TO PROTECT SURFACES FROM SCRATCHES & WATER SPOTS:  Our signature dual-layer construction is completely washable and will last for years.  All-natural cork is pressure bonded to composite wood backing, with protective felt feet to provide the ultimate in surface protection. MADE IN IN USA BY OUR OWN TEAM OF ARTISTANS:  Hand crafted by our own full-time staff of artisans right here in the United States. FUN THEMES FOR ALL INTERESTS:  More than 500 endearing designs offered individually or in sets.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zw8b3kf2L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GrafixMat","source_asin":"B07KCY68V3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-235215","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KCY68V3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KCY68V3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":235216,"name":"Neck Pillow for Travel Inflatable Airplane Pillow Comfortably Supports Head, Neck and Chin, Inflatable Travel Pillow with Soft Velour Cover and Portab","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tbtohC7GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Unique Hooded Design】: H-shaped travel neck pillow, multi-directional use. Keep your head in a comfortable position at all times, the side wings on both sides prevent your head and neck from over-tilting, and the flat back of the travel pillow will not cause any pressure on your neck. 【High Quality Velvet 】: Enjoy our superior-quality velvet travel pillows. Our travel pillows for airplanes are lighter, more convenient and easier to clean than traditional memory foam travel pillow. Velvet cover is easy to be removed and put on for machine-washing. Keep your inflatable pillow clean at all times. Adjustable Velcro holds the head in a comfortable position. 【Carry Convinent, Save Space 】: Inflatable Travel Pillow is lightweight, designed with travelers in mind. The neck pillows for travel can be easily stowed away in waterproof drawstring bag for easy carrying and storage to your carry on luggage or backpack during travel or business trip. While you’re on the go and it protects your travel pillow from dust and dirt. 【Fast Filling】: The neck travel pillow can be inflated in 3 seconds without embarrassment in public. This patented valve maintains good air and does not leak for a long time. The most comfortable to relax if the travel neck pillow is blow up to 80-90%. 【Excellent Travel Companion】: Everyone need a high quality travel neck pillow. This travel pillow can provides extra support to protect the neck from pain when you are sitting in the seat on a plane, train, car or bus. It's also a good idea for office and home. When you are reading, watching TV and make your office lunch break more relaxing. You can also purchase for your family, friends and colleagues. It is a perfect gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tbtohC7GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sunany","source_asin":"B0BTNWBVMN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-235216","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTNWBVMN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTNWBVMN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
