window.products.push({"id":235332,"name":"AmazerBath Bath Tub Mat, Medium Size 27.6 x 15 Inches Non-Slip Shower Mats with Suction Cups and Drain Holes, Bathtub Mats Bathroom Mats Machine Washa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wEUI6lHUL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Suitable Size: The shower mat measures 27.6 x 15 inches, and its rectangular shape allows it to lay flat on any smooth bathtub. It is very suitable for bathtubs and shower rooms at homes, gyms, hospitals, hotels, and so on. Strong Grip: This bathtub mat non slip with 149 powerful suction cups that keep the mat firmly in place. The subtle textured pattern on the surface provides the necessary anti-slip function, soft on the feet, and provides a massage experience in the shower. Easy Water Drainage: Hundreds of drainage holes allow water to easily flow from under the non slip bathtub mat to the drain, helping to prevent water from staying on the bath tub mat. This design also keeps the bath tub slip matt dry and clean. Durable Material: The anti slip bath mats for tub is made of durable and safe latex-free material, which is safe for the skin. The shower mats are machine washable and easy to clean. Just toss it in the washing machine and let it air dry. Good to Know: Bathtub mat only attaches to smooth clean surfaces instead of textured, tiled, or non-smooth surfaces. To avoid falls, please moisten the tub with a little bit of water before filling the tub mat, then press the bath tub mat with your hands to secure suction cups tightly on the smooth bathtub.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wEUI6lHUL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AmazerBath","source_asin":"B081MRQ5DD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-235332","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081MRQ5DD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081MRQ5DD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
