window.products.push({"id":235465,"name":"Hughapy Chair Cushions Desk Seat Cushion Warm Comfort Sherpa Wool Seat Cushion Pad for Support Waist Backrest, Winter Plush Cushion for Home Office Ch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MD1jWfmCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Unique Design: The support waist cushion has a large fan-shaped waist protection design, which can keep your waist warm. The fan-shaped waist protectors on either side can not only ensure that your waist and spine are well supported and wrapped when you sit on the chair, but also protect your waist from being frozen in the cold autumn and winter seasons, effectively preventing the damage to your waist and spine caused by the cold weather. Multiple Material Protection: The inner surface of the cushion is made of high-quality sherpa material, lightweight and soft, keep you comfortable and warm in autumn, winter. Waterproof Oxford cloth and thermal insulation aluminum foil are used on the outside, firm, and strong, which can effectively prevent moisture from entering the cushion. The inner core is made of high-quality PP cotton, which has better softness, fluffy feeling, good resilience. Widely Usage: Whether it is placed on the seats of the dining room, study, bedroom, and office, or on the ground, bed, and car, the cashmere cushion can warm the whole heart. It adopts the foldable routing design, which can be folded and stored when not in use, saving space. Size Choice: The 19Wx16Lx16H size is suitable for the standard weight of people and kids. If you have a bigger somatotype or you want a more comfortable experience, this 24Wx16Lx16H size is suitable for you. Washing Instructions: Wash the cushion in mild detergent and cool or lukewarm water. Never use hot water, even if the Sherpa blanket is made of cotton. Do not bleach a Sherpa cushion. To treat a stain, soak it with a little dishwashing liquid. Let it sit for 10 minutes. Blot it with a paper towel. Then wash and dry the cushion.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MD1jWfmCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hughapy","source_asin":"B07WR3PJBT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-235465","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WR3PJBT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WR3PJBT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
