window.products.push({"id":235754,"name":"Envirosax Reusable Grocery Bags- Set of 3 Oriental Spice, Foldable Quality Shopping Tote Bag, Eco-Friendly Polyester, Waterproof and Machine Washable.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DXwqyIDML._AC_.jpg","description":"Envirosax Reusable Grocery/Travel Bags- Set of 3 Oriental Spice design ​​Introducing the well-known Envirosax eco-friendly bags in a charming set of 3 Oriental designs. Synonymous with quality and one of the oldest reusable bag brands, Envirosax make a wonderful gift item or keep them for yourself!A convenient eco friendly reusable bag that folds up to a small size and can be stored neatly in your handbag, pocket, backpack or glove compartment. A variety of uses, this great little bag is super strong and weighs in at just 1.4oz. Holding two plastic grocery bags of shopping, Envirosax have been tested to hold at least 44lbs. As Light as a Lipstick and as Strong as a Suitcase! WHY ENVIROSAX? Envirosax has a goal of combining lifestyle, design, and functionality, in eco-friendly products. Our company will provide value to our customers by providing the best quality products in the market at the best price. Our customer service team is friendly and responsible, so if you have any questions, concerns or suggestions, feel free to contact us. CHECK OUT OUR OTHER STYLES AVAILABLE FOR YOU TO CHOOSE FROM IS THIS PRODUCT FOR YOU? Do you live in an area where there is a plastic bag ban?  Do you run to the grocery store only to have left your reusable bag at home? Do you often wish you had another tote when you are travelling? Do you need a spare bag in the car just to keep toys or diapers in? With a zillion uses, our high-quality eco bags are sold in great value bundles. Buy to use one and keep the others on hand, or give them away as gifts. Envirosax is synonymous with quality and by buying these bags, you know you are not only saving the environment, but also buying a product that will last a very long time. It’s also for you if you’re trying to find the perfect gift for your family, friends or loved ones but don’t want to disappoint them with cheap quality.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DXwqyIDML._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Envirosax","source_asin":"B07JMLZ877","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-235754","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JMLZ877","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JMLZ877","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
