window.products.push({"id":235795,"name":"Cloudz Patterned Microbead Travel Neck Pillows - Black/White Print","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.45,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iFwNbWooL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"**GUARANTEED | BUY WITH CONFIDENCE. Our customers come first! Seems like everyone is offering a travel pillow these days, but why take a chance with an “unknown” brand. Clöudz is one of the originators and innovators of the travel pillow. We have been here for the last 15+ years and will be here for many years to come. **THE ORIGINAL MICROBEAD TRAVEL PILLOW by Clöudz! Why take a chance on an imitation? For over 15 years, Millions of happy travelers have used our pillows in airports around the globe! **FILLED WITH EXCLUSIVE, ULTRA-PREMIUM Comforlite MICROBEADS. Our super small polystyrene beads will give you the relaxing support you need and will conform to your every position. However, they will not crush easily like so many other pillows on the market who use inferior quality beads. Buy the pillow that lasts! **SNAP CLOSURE. Allows you to secure the pillow around your neck to help prevent your head from falling forward so you can catch some Z’s! **EASILY ATTACHES TO LUGGAGE. Simply snap around the handle of your luggage or to your backpack. A very hand feature during your travels. **USE IT AS A LUMBAR SUPPORT! Our pillow doubles as a lumbar support. Super soft and super versatile. **USE IT FRONTWARDS LIKE A MASSAGE TABLE PILLOW! Simply close the snap and rest your face forward into the pillow. **USE ON-THE-GO OR AT HOME. Our pillow is just as comfortable on the couch or on the bed!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iFwNbWooL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cloudz","source_asin":"B07L8R59LS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-235795","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07L8R59LS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07L8R59LS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
