window.products.push({"id":235975,"name":"PureComfort Memory Foam Pillow - Neck & Shoulder Pain Relief Pillow - Adjustable Hypoallergenic Memory Foam Pillow for Back, Stomach, or Side Sleepers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DjmD1bFfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EXPERIENCE PURE COMFORT: You deserve unmatched comfort with the right neck and back support as you fall into a deep sleep. Our luxury pillow memory foam can work as a side sleeping pillow, a sleep apnea pillow, or back sleeper pillow. FULLY ADJUSTABLE: Our pillow for side sleepers, stomach sleepers, and back sleepers features a proprietary mix of shredded visco elastic memory foam, which you can add or remove to reach your ideal fill. PROMOTE PROPER ALIGNMENT: Get the support you need for a restful night. Plus our cool tech construction keeps you cool and comfortable all night long. SAFE, TESTED, & ALLERGY-RESISTANT: All of the foam use in our pillows for side sleepers meet the CertiPUR-US standards for content, emissions, and durability, and are analyzed by independent, accredited testing labs. Our shredded memory foam pillows are made without PBDEs, TDCPP, TCEP flame retardants, mercury, lead or other heavy metals, formaldehyde, or phthalates. COOL & SOFT: Our propriety bamboo-derived rayon cover with keep you cool and comfortable all night long. Easily remove and machine wash the rayon cover to ensure your pillow stays fresh. If you aren't satisfied with your new pillow, enjoy a 60 day money back guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DjmD1bFfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PureComfort","source_asin":"B0774LZTYQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-235975","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0774LZTYQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0774LZTYQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
