window.products.push({"id":235978,"name":"Carpet Tape Rug Pud Anti Curling Rug Grippers Non Slip CarpetGripper for Hardwood Floors Anti Slip Rug Gripper Grips Reusable","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91epYegkZQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Operating the Can Opener Step1 - Place the Can Opener on top of the can with its rim positioned in the groove between the Cutter and the Drive Wheel Step2 - With the can on a flat surface, press the Button for about one second and release, then the Can Opener will start cutting the side of the can Step3 - When the cutting has completed, press the button immediately to reverse the cutter Step4 - Make sure that the cutter resets to the start position and the motor stops. Then, lift the can opener off the can Trouble Shooting 1. If batteries are depleted, the can may not be released by pressing the button. Slide back the Battery Door and replace 2 AA batteries. The Can Opener should continue the cutting. Remember to replace the battery. 2. Cans with heavy seams and uneven rims may stall the Can Opener. If this happens, follow above procedure to release the can. 3. If the can is get stucked, please press the white button on the top of the can opener. Note: 1) Use 2 new batteries ( High quality AA batteries), cheaper less quality new batteries are inadequate and may not preform as necessary. 2) After completely revolving around the can and cutting the edge, the can will still appear to be sealed. After prying up the lid will it be evident that the can and its resealable lid are detached. 15) Do not lift or forcefully remove the can opener from the can while it is operational. Forceful removal can cause damage to the knife-edge.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91epYegkZQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Procan","source_asin":"B07CG6BS1Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-235978","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CG6BS1Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CG6BS1Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":235979,"name":"Homaxy Faux Leather Strip Woven Round Table Placemats, Set of 4 Heat Insulation Stain Resistant Non-Slip Table Mats for Kitchen Table, Washable Wipe C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719pgwfCNNS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIGH QUALITY MATERIAL: Our placemats are made of 100% artificial leather polyester. Exquisite and elegant leather placemats, exquisite workmanship, strong and durable, can be used for a long time. They can effectively protect your dining table from scratches, heat and stains, thereby extending the service life of the dining table. THE FEATURES: Heat resistance and slip resistance. The uneven matte surface design on the back of these placemats enhances the non-slip ability of the placemats. The cross-knitting of the front strip not only enhances the aesthetics, but also achieves the effect of double-sided non-slip. The double-layer thickening enhances the heat insulation effect of the placemat, and the effective heat insulation effect can reach 212°F. It can be washed with water without fading and staining. DESIGN: The unique wedge-shaped fan shape design and the intersecting three-dimensional strip weave make the whole more fashionable and beautiful. Perfect to add to your dining table, special fashionable place mats to add more fun to your kitchen table, coffee time. These place mats can be used as decorations to add to your dining pleasure. EASY CARE: Leather placemats are easy to clean. Please clean the placemats in time when they are dirty, wipe them with a damp cloth or rinse with water, wipe dry or air dry. No machine wash. No microwave. It can be rolled up for storage and laid flat when used. MULTIPLE USES: Suitable for indoor and outdoor. 44 x 30cm or 17.3 x 11.8inch perfect fit on kitchen and patio tables. Such as family kitchen, restaurant, coffee shop, hotel, dining table, business office, party dinner, barbecue, wedding, etc. It is also the best gift choice for Mother's Day, Father's Day, housewarming, and friends visiting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719pgwfCNNS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homaxy","source_asin":"B08Y5F5J2T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-235979","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Y5F5J2T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Y5F5J2T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
